{"4058300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Siren", "steam_appid": 4058300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/9aab09b59f7d1e8cc08e4d61d0784ac0.poster.avif?t=1787166195\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/9aab09b59f7d1e8cc08e4d61d0784ac0.webm?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/b1cbf8f07f1fa082aa93964a620c660d.avif?t=1787166195\" width=354 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Siren</strong> is a Lovecraftian World War II horror fairytale. When the lone survivor of the U.S.S. Siren, Alexander Calder, discovers a mermaid while adrift at sea, he finds himself plunged into a world of supernatural horror fathoms beneath the surface. Survive terrifying creatures, navigate alien technology, and discover the secrets of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize unique gameplay mechanics to understand what is real as Alexander battles to hold on to his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the works of Lovecraft and classic creature feature films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/94e2e328905ae119960c4cfb68a00bc5.poster.avif?t=1787166195\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/94e2e328905ae119960c4cfb68a00bc5.webm?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/94e2e328905ae119960c4cfb68a00bc5.mp4?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/cea6d5bfb3889ec9f30685d34b69167e.avif?t=1787166195\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/00fa6b5f8d8e7baf8f4905e7fb633933.avif?t=1787166195\" width=354 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/52b82b17add36fb3af5a0e2c8d3bd7da.poster.avif?t=1787166195\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/52b82b17add36fb3af5a0e2c8d3bd7da.webm?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural and psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique eye-closing puzzle mechanic to decipher if what you're seeing is even real</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized hand-drawn experience filled with creatures and pulpy sci-fi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and challenging puzzles from a strange underwater world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voiceover and immersive sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-original, intense movie-quality soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets to unlock cosmetics for your HUD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/090a141c9c9544114b08d34efc475f17.poster.avif?t=1787166195\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/090a141c9c9544114b08d34efc475f17.webm?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/090a141c9c9544114b08d34efc475f17.mp4?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/cea6d5bfb3889ec9f30685d34b69167e.avif?t=1787166195\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/9aab09b59f7d1e8cc08e4d61d0784ac0.poster.avif?t=1787166195\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/9aab09b59f7d1e8cc08e4d61d0784ac0.webm?t=1787166195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058300/extras/b1cbf8f07f1fa082aa93964a620c660d.avif?t=1787166195\" width=354 heig